<descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An account that is intended to be used to run a service. A service account has privileges beyond those provided when a service is run as part of the system, such as the ability to connect over the network to another computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="228771">service account</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2297298">পরিষেবা অ্যাকাউন্ট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10380_156547_1687088"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A document describing a company's position on privacy, detailing what information it collects, with whom the data is shared, and how users can control the use of their personal information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="156547">privacy statement</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1687088">গোপনীয়তা বিবৃতি</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10380_156547_1687901"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A document describing a company's position on privacy, detailing what information it collects, with whom the data is shared, and how users can control the use of their personal information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="156547">privacy statement</term><termNo