 on the affected user's phone bill.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="297179">dialer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="614615">ডায়ালার</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13370_33049_613295"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To end an application's relationship with an open file so that the application will no longer be able to access the file without opening it again.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="33049">close</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="613295">বন্ধ করুন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13372_413712_1255952"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A symbol that is displayed beside a paragraph in outline view. You can use the symbol to display or hide subordinate levels of text and to reorganize text quickly.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="413712">outline symbol</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1255952">প্রান্তরেখা প্রতীক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender