 type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14845_157682_472208"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows security feature that locks a user account if a number of failed logon attempts occur within a specified amount of time, based on security policy lockout settings. Locked accounts cannot log on.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="157682">account lockout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="472208">একাউন্ট লকআউট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14845_157682_614136"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows security feature that locks a user account if a number of failed logon attempts occur within a specified amount of time, based on security policy lockout settings. Locked accounts cannot log on.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="157682">account lockout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="614136">হিসাব বন্ধকরণ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14848_253634_471671"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A line or row of characters used to lead the eye from a data label to a data point, or from a callout to the appropriate part of an illustration