 BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15144_346594_473029"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The time for which a dry or alkaline cell is able to produce an electric current before it needs to be replaced.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="346594">battery life</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="473029">ব্যাটারি আয়ু</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15151_68314_1772521"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Characterized by conversational exchange of input and output, as when a user enters a question or command and the system immediately responds. The interactivity of microcomputers is one of the features that makes them approachable and easy to use.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="68314">interactive</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1772521">মিথস্ক্রিয়</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15151_68314_471628"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Characterized by conversational exchange of input and output, as when a user enters a question or command and the system immediately responds. The interactivity of microcomputers is one of the features that makes them approachable and easy to use.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="68314">interactive</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="471628">পরস্পর ক্রিয়াশীল</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15153_304427_1255981"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An exponentiation operator used in some programming languages. For example, the expression 3^2 represents the number 3 raised to the second power.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="304427">caret</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1255981">ক্যারেট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15154_2421378_1546257"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A work item that records a possible event with an undesirable outcome.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2421378">risk event</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1546257">ঝুঁকি</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="