ass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2774777">টেলিকনফারেন্সিং</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15382_232822_1853899"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An option that switches the view from the display of HTML source code to the display of Web page content.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232822">Exit HTML Source</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1853899">HTML উত্স বন্ধ করুন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15383_2482719_2485858"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The primary circuit board in a computer that contains most of the basic components of the system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2482719">baseboard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2485858">বেসবোর্ড</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15383_81653_2485858"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The primary circuit board in a computer that contains most of the basic components of the system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="81653">motherboard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2485858">বেসবোর্ড</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15383_81654_2485858"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The primary circuit board in a computer that contains most of the basic components of the system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="81654">system board</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2485858">বেসবোর্ড</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15384_178508_2344475"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An order for a large quantity of products or services. The minimum quantity that qualifies as a bulk order is set by individual companies.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="178508">bulk order</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2344475">প্রচুর পরিমাণে অর্ডার</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singula