 text by visually lengthening words rather than increasing the spacing between words. Can also function like a hyphen.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650941">kashidas</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1466575">কাশিদা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="18587_650941_1944697"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The special characters used to extend the joiner between two Arabic characters. Used to improve the appearance of justified text by visually lengthening words rather than increasing the spacing between words. Can also function like a hyphen.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650941">kashidas</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1944697">kashidas</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="18590_650944_1424689"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Resolving resource conflicts or overallocations by delaying or splitting certain tasks. When Project levels a resource, its selected assignments are distributed and rescheduled.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650944">leveling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><t