. as a revision to the Julian calendar.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="652286">Gregorian calendar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1256035">গ্রেগোরিয়ান ক্যালেন্ডার</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="19285_652286_1413460"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A calendar in widespread use. It was introduced in 1582 A.D. as a revision to the Julian calendar.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="652286">Gregorian calendar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1413460">গ্রিগোরিয়ান ক্যালেন্ডার</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="19285_652286_1466583"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A calendar in widespread use. It was introduced in 1582 A.D. as a revision to the Julian calendar.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="652286">Gregorian calendar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1466583">গ্রেগোরিয়ান পঞ্জিকা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="19291_652263_1256036"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An XML structure that consists of a start tag, an end tag, and the information between the tags. Elements can have attributes and can contain other elements.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="652263">XML element</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1256036">XML উপাদান</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="19291_652263_1466584"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An XML structure that consists of a start tag, an end tag, and the information between the tags. Elements can have attributes and can contain other elements.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="652263">XML element</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1466584">XML উপকরণ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="19295_652267_1854040"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A switch (\#) or instruction that specifies how Microsoft Word will display the numeric result of a field.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="652267">numeric picture switch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1854040">সাংখ্যিক চিত্র স্যুইচ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="19296_652268_1854041"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A switch (\*) or instruction that specifies the capitalization, numeral style, and character formatting that Microsoft Word uses in a field result.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="652268">format switch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1854041">বিন্যাস স্যুইচ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1930_46651_471480"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A device used to store information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="46651">disk</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="471480">ডিস্ক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="19300_652272_1256037"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to information that shows what has actually occurred. For example, the actual start date for a task is the day that the task actually started.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="652272">actual</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1256037">প্রকৃত</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="19301_652273_1424705"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The percentage of a resource's capacity that is designated for a specific assignment.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="652273">allocation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1424705">বরাদ্দকরণ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="19301_652273_1453922"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The percentage of a resource's capacity that is designated for a specific assignment.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="652273">allocation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1453922">বন্টিত শতাংশ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</term