it is said to be authoritative for names within that zone.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="17347">authoritative server</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1959426">প্রামাণিক সার্ভার</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2378_17347_2296998"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to, or characteristic of, a DNS server that hosts a primary or secondary copy of a DNS zone. When a DNS server is configured to host a zone, it is said to be authoritative for names within that zone.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="17347">authoritative server</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2296998">বিশ্বাসযোগ্য সার্ভার</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23796_1089872_2702454"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A loop that, because of semantic or logic errors, can never terminate through normal means.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1089872">infinite loop</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2702454">অসীম লুপ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="238_41773_2297050"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Exchange 5.5 and earlier, a custom recipient is a user who is not hosted by Exchange. In Exchange 2003, such users can be added to Active Directory as contacts, Windows users, or users whose Windows accounts are disabled. In any case, they are mail-enabled, but not mailbox-enabled, because their mailboxes are hosted on another messaging system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="41773">custom recipient</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2297050">কাস্টম প্রাপক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2382_231960_1853870"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A method of summarizing values in the data area of a PivotTable report by using the values in other cells in the data area. Use the Show data as list on the PivotTable Field dialog for a data field to create custom calculations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="231960">custom calculation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1853870">কাস্টম গণনা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23840_1091236_1256233"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A video clip that has been inserted into another file or Web page.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091236">embedded video clip</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1256233">সন্নিবেশিত ভিডিও ক্লিপ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23840_1091236_1413240"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A video clip that has been inserted into another file or Web page.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091236">embedded video clip</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1413240">এম্বেডেড ভিডিও ক্লিপ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23840_1091236_1770011"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A video clip that has been inserted into another file or Web page.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091236">embedded video clip</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1770011">এম্বেড করা ভিডিও ক্লিপ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23840_1091236_1778131"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A video clip that has been inserted into another file or Web page.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091236">embedded video clip</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1778131">প্রোথিত সচলচিত্র ক্লিপ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23841_1091237_1413238"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An audio clip that has been inserted into another file or Web page.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091237">embedded audio clip</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1413238">এম্বেডেড অডিও ক্লিপ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23841_1091237_1770006"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An audio clip that has been inserted into another file or Web page.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091237">embedded audio clip</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1770006">এম্বেড করা অডিও ক্লিপ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23841_1091237_1778124"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An audio clip that has been inserted into another file or Web page.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091237">embedded audio clip</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1778124">প্রোথিত শব্দ ক্লিপ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23864_1091326_1971164"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A standard control that resembles a notebook and lets the user navigate different sections of information without leaving the current element on the screen.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091326">tab control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1971164">ট্যাব নিয়ন্ত্রণ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23869_1091332_2816042"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In mathematics, an item that is multiplied in a multiplication problem; for example, 2 and 3 are factors in the problem 2 x 3. The prime factors of a number are a set of prime numbers that, when multiplied together, produce the number.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091332">factor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816042">ফ্যাক্টর</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23871_1091334_1519163"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An ability to view data or navigate to or within a physical or virtual computer environment.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091334">access</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1519163">অ্যাক্সেস</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23871_1091334_1519793"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An ability to view data or navigate to or within a physical or virtual computer environment.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091334">access</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1519793">প্রবেশাধিকার</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23872_1091335_1520153"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An account holder who is a family member, but not a parent, and who has limited use of the Internet. Children can view their own settings, but they can't change them.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091335">child</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1520153">শিশু</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23873_1091336_2952175"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An account holder who is a parent or a child.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091336">family member</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2952175">পরিবারের সদস্য</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23874_1091337_1519955"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An account holder who is the primary administrator (parent) and the family members they manage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091337">family</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1519955">পারিবারিক প্রধান</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23874_1091337_1520167"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An account holder who is the primary administrator (parent) and the family members they manage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091337">family</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1520167">পরিবার</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23875_1091338_1256235"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To combine thereby increasing the quantity or size of something.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091338">add</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1256235">যোগ করা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23875_1091338_1771214"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To combine thereby increasing the quantity or size of something.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091338">add</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1771214">যুক্ত করুন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23876_1091339_1520240"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To adjust the action or aspects of a group of items, typically done more than once.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091339">manage</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1520240">পরিচালনা করা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2388_415516_1853943"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A name assigned to a cell or group of cells.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="415516">range name</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1853943">ব্যাপ্তি নাম</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="239_252121_1853918"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A combination of list formatting options identified by a style name.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="252121">list style</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1853918">তালিকা শৈলী</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23919_1092267_1373242"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A “software-plus-services” platform and experience that enables PCs and other devices to “come alive” by making them aware of each other through the Internet, enabling individuals and organizations to manage, access, and share their files and applications seamlessly on the Web and across their world of devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1092267">Live Mesh</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1373242">Live Mesh</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23919_1379736_1373242"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A “software-plus-services” platform and experience that enables PCs and other devices to “come alive” by making them aware of each other through the Internet, enabling individuals and organizations to manage, access, and share their files and applications seamlessly on the Web and across their world of devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1379736">Windows Live Mesh</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></