 range of products and services predominantly related to computing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2239897">MSFT</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1647730">Microsoft</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28358_1585472_1959546"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A connection established between on-premises and cloud email systems that not only allows users to use email from either location with the same set of credentials, but provides a richer management experience.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1585472">Exchange hybrid deployment</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1959546">Exchange হাইব্রিড নিয়োজন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28358_1585472_2297110"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A connection established between on-premises and cloud email systems that not only allows users to use email from either location with the same set of credentials, but provides a richer management experience.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1585472">Exchange hybrid deployment</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2297110">Exchange হাইব্রিড নিযুক্তি</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2839_37265_1546237"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of instructions in some computer language intended to be executed on a computer so as to perform some task. The term usually implies a self-contained entity, as opposed to a routine or a library.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="37265">computer program</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1546237">কম্পিউটার প্রোগ্রাম</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28405_1484852_2725665"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of services designed to help evaluate organizations' environments, develop customized Microsoft SharePoint deployment plans, and that is part of software assurance coverage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1484852">SharePoint Deployment Planning Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2725665">SDPS</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28405_1484852_2725667"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of services designed to help evaluate organizations' environments, develop customized Microsoft SharePoint deployment plans, and that is part of software assurance coverage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1484852">SharePoint Deployment Planning Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2725667">SharePoint ডিপ্লয়মেন্ট পরিকল্পনা পরিষেবাদি</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28405_1673938_2725665"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of services designed to help evaluate organizations' environments, develop customized Microsoft SharePoint deployment plans, and that is part of software assurance coverage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1673938">SDPS</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2725665">SDPS</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28405_1673938_2725667"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of services designed to help evaluate organizations' environments, develop customized Microsoft SharePoint deployment plans, and that is part of software assurance coverage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1673938">SDPS</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2725667">SharePoint ডিপ্লয়মেন্ট পরিকল্পনা পরিষেবাদি</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28406_1484854_2725652"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Software Assurance benefit delivered by Microsoft Certified Partner that consists of one to fifteen days of planning the deployment of Microsoft Office Software for a specific organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1484854">Microsoft Desktop Deployment Planning Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2725652">Microsoft ডেস্কটপ ডিপ্লয়মেন্ট পরিকল্পনা পরিষেবাদি</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28426_1486692_2686834"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An entity that represents a service at the Key Distribution Center (KDC). The service principal has a name and an associated key. A subclass of principal, a service principal generally does not correspond to a human user of the system, but rather to an automated service providing a resource, such as a file server.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1486692">service principal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2686834">সার্ভিস প্রিন্সিপাল</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28436_1487678_1597646"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A visual representation such as a picture, chart or table.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1487678">graphic</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1597646">গ্রাফিক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28436_1487678_1772459"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A visual representation such as a picture, chart or table.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1487678">graphic</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1772459">সচিত্র</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2846_297003_1257945"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A trojan that captures and/or transmits passwords to an attacker.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="297003">password stealer</term><