 that parses code and markup in a page to help ensure that only trusted code and markup is run on a computer, server farm, or server cluster.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508552">safe mode parser</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1854252">নিরাপদ মোড পার্সার</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29440_1508555_1854253"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The area of the Help window that contains a Help topic.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508555">topic pane</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1854253">প্রসঙ্গ ফলক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29442_1508557_1854254"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A list that identifies which assemblies and types are allowed to run on Web Parts pages in a server farm. The list is stored in the web.config file for the server farm.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508557">SafeControl list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1854254">নিরাপদ নিয়ন্ত্রণ তালিকা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOf