ammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1639642">স্বয়ংক্রিয় দেখাশোনা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31295_1598405_1771492"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature of Windows that includes a set of maintenance tasks that run automatically when the user's PC is idle.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1598405">Automatic Maintenance</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1771492">স্বয়ংক্রিয় রক্ষণাবেক্ষণ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31296_1598406_1639712"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature of BitLocker that enables IT pros to encrypt a disk before a user begins to use it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1598406">BitLocker encrypted installation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1639712">BitLocker এনক্রিপ্টেড সংস্থাপন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31296_1598406_1771561"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><de