search results.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653528">refinable managed property</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1855862">পরিশোধনযোগ্য পরিচালিত বিশিষ্টতা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32344_1653529_1854443"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A managed property that can be displayed in search results.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653529">retrievable managed property</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1854443">পুনরুদ্ধারযোগ্য পরিচালিত বিশিষ্টতা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32344_1653529_1855863"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A managed property that can be displayed in search results.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653529">retrievable managed property</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1855863">পুনরুদ্ধারযোগ্য পরিচালিত বিশিষ্টতা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32345_1653531_1854444"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A managed property whose value can be returned by a query.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653531">searchable managed property</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1854444">সন্ধানযোগ্য পরিচালিত বিশিষ্টতা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32346_1653533_1854445"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A managed property whose result set can be sorted based on the property before the result set is returned.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653533">sortable managed property</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1854445">সঞ্চয়যোগ্য পরিচালিত বিশিষ্টতা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32350_1656127_1854446"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A user defined dictionary that lists single words or phrases that the system matches to words in the content in either a case-sensitive way or a case-insensitive way, depending on the type of dictionary that is used.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656127">custom extraction dictionary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1854446">কাস্টম নিষ্কাশন অভিধান</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32351_1656134_1854447"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A custom extraction dictionary that lists words or phrases that are matched to exact words in the content in a case-sensitive way. For example, the system matches "anchor" to "anchor," but not to "Anchor" or "Anchorage."</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656134">exact word extraction dictionary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1854447">যথাযথ শব্দ নিষ্কাশন অভিধান</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32351_1656134_1855867"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A custom extraction dictionary that lists words or phrases that are matched to exact words in the content in a case-sensitive way. For example, the system matches "anchor" to "anchor," but not to "Anchor" or "Anchorage."</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656134">exact word extraction dictionary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1855867">যথাযথ শব্দ নিষ্কাশন অভিধান</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32352_1656137_1854448"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A custom extraction dictionary that lists words or phrases that are matched anywhere in the content in a case-sensitive way. For example, the system matches "anchor" and "anchorage," but not "Anchor."</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656137">exact word part extraction dictionary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1854448">যথাযথ শব্দ অংশ নিষ্কাশন অভিধান</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32353_1656140_1854449"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A custom extraction dictionary that lists words or phrases that are matched to exact words in the content in a case-insensitive way. For example, the entry "anchor" will match "anchor" and "Anchor," but not "anchorage."</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656140">word extraction dictionary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1854449">শব্দ নিষ্কাশন অভিধান</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32354_1656141_1854450"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A custom extraction dictionary that lists words or phrases that are matched anywhere in the content in a case-insensitive way. For example, the entry "anchor" will match "anchor," "Anchor," and "anchorage."</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656141">word part extraction dictionary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1854450">শব্দ অংশ নিষ্কাশন অভিধান</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32355_1656142_1854451"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A data structure that describes crawled properties, managed properties, and the mapping between them.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656142">search schema</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1854451">সন্ধান স্কীম</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32356_1656144_1854452"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A logical portion of the search index.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656144">index partition</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1854452">বিষয়সূচি বিভাজন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32359_1657886_1662387"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of apps that includes Messenger, Photo Gallery, Movie Maker, OneDrive, Mail, Writer, and Family Safety. (Family Safety is only included in Windows 7 downloads; it's built in to Windows 8.)</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1657886">Windows Essentials 2012</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1662387">Windows এসেনশিয়ালস 2012</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32359_1657886_1771844"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of apps that includes Messenger, Photo Gallery, Movie Maker, OneDrive, Mail, Writer, and Family Safety. (Family Safety is only included in Windows 7 downloads; it's built in to Windows 8.)</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1657886">Windows Essentials 2012</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1771844">Windows অপরিহার্য্য বিষয়বস্তু ২০১২</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3236_80090_2115642"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The use of computers and data communication equipment to convey messages from one person to another, as by email, voice mail, or fax.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="80090">messaging</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2115642">বার্তা প্রেরণ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32361_1658247_2610690"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tool in Office 365 that enables IT professionals to manage how Office is installed for their users. Users receive the correct language and configurations individually tailored to them automatically, without the need to install anything themselves.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1658247">Office Deployment Tool</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2610690">Office ডিপ্লোয়মেন্ট সরঞ্জাম</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32362_1658249_1854454"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mode in which SharePoint Server is the primary source for all the project details. Project Server scheduling, time and status, and advanced functionality are disabled.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1658249">visibility mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1854454">দৃশ্যমানতা মোড</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32362_1658249_1855874"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mode in which SharePoint Server is the primary source for all the project details. Project Server scheduling, time and status, and advanced functionality are disabled.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1658249">visibility mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1855874">দৃশ্যমানতা মোড</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32367_1666384_1686525"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows feature that enables users to connect computers with a simple tap gesture or by browsing for computers within wireless range. If two computers come within 3-4 centimeters of each other, or are tapped together, the operating system of each computer becomes aware of the other computer. Also, a user can browse for computers within wireless range that are advertising for a peer connection. The user can then connect the two computers to share content such as photos or links, or create a multi-player experience. If the connection is made using a tap gesture, the user can also publish and subscribe to messages transmitted during the tap.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1666384">proximity</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1686525">নৈকট্য</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3239_1513455_1640501"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A certification authority that has the ability to issue the intermediate certificates needed to certify the subject identified by the end certificate.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1513455">intermediate CA</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1640501">মধ্যস্থ CA</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3239_1513455_1640530"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A certification authority that has the ability to issue the intermediate certificates needed to certify the subject identified by the end certificate.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1513455">intermediate CA</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1640530">মধ্যস্থ শংসাপত্র আধিকারিক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3239_1513455_1645884"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A certification authority that has the ability to issue the intermediate certificates needed to certify the subject identified by the end certificate.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1513455">intermediate CA</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1645884">মধ্যস্তরের CA</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3239_1513455_1772523"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A certification authority that has the ability to issue the intermediate certificates needed to certify the subject identified by the end certificate.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1513455">intermediate CA</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1772523">ইন্টারমিডিয়েট সার্টিফিকেশন অথরিটি</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3239_68764_1640501"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A certification authority that has the ability to issue the intermediate certificates needed to certify the subject identified by the end certificate.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="68764">intermediate certification authority</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type