ar 2016 edition of Microsoft Office available to students who attend an educational institution.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2482683">Office Professional Academic 2016 for PC</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2279537">Office Professional Academic 2016</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39079_2270271_2281344"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook folder where low priority messages are moved either via the Clutter filter or by the user, based on individual user preferences.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2270271">Clutter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2281344">ক্লাটার</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3909_7248_2296968"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Windows-based computers, a 32-bit value (a bitmask) that specifies the permissions that are assigned in an access control entry (ACE). An access mask is also part of the access request when an object is opened. The access mask in the request is compared to the access mask in each ACE to determine whether or not to grant the request.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="7248">access mask</term><termNote type="partOfSp