oss all email accounts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312655">Focused Inbox</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321937">ফোকাসযুক্ত ইনবক্স</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39857_2312655_2427346"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that intelligently presorts email across all email accounts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312655">Focused Inbox</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2427346">গুরুত্বসহ চিহ্নিত ইনবক্স</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39858_2312656_2321941"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The menu selection that allows users to move emails from the focused inbox into the Other category.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312656">Move to Non-Focused Inbox</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321941">ফোকাসযুক্ত নয় এমন ইনবক্সে যান</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39858_2312656_2427350"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The menu selection that allows users to move emails from the focused inbox into the Other category.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312656">Move to Non-Focused Inbox</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2427350">অ-গুরুত্বসহ চিহ্নিত ইনবক্স এ যান</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39864_2322624_2328040"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The wireless personal area network technology, launched in 2010 and marketed as Bluetooth Smart, used for transmitting data over distances as much as 100 meters. Cost and power consumption are low while maintaining a communication range similar to Bluetooth BR/EDR, the other widely-used version of Bluetooth</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322624">Bluetooth Smart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2328040">Bluetooth Smart</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39866_2315181_2321735"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Bluetooth Low Energy device that sends static information, such as location or ID, to devices within its area.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2315181">beacon</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321735">সংকেত</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39866_2315181_2322540"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Bluetooth Low Energy device that sends static information, such as location or ID, to devices within its area.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2315181">beacon</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322540">বিকন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3987_141789_1853775"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A placeholder text that included the field character, field type, and instructions, and that that shows where specified information from a data source will appear such that the elements in a field that generate a field's result.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="141789">field code</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1853775">ফিল্ড কোড</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3987_141789_1955188"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A placeholder text that included the field character, field type, and instructions, and that that shows where specified information from a data source will appear such that the elements in a field that generate a field's result.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="141789">field code</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1955188">ক্ষেত্র কোড</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39877_2315966_2322548"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature for maps of the interior of some public places, such as the businesses inside a mall, or the gates, businesses, and other services inside an airport.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2315966">venue map</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322548">স্থান মানচিত্র</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39878_2316274_2321739"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Of, pertaining to, or characteristic of apps or services made available in an enterprise to help with particular business and process needs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2316274">line-of-business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321739">লাইন-অফ-বিজনেস</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39878_2316274_2321740"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Of, pertaining to, or characteristic of apps or services made available in an enterprise to help with particular business and process needs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2316274">line-of-business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321740">LOB</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39878_2316275_2321739"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Of, pertaining to, or characteristic of apps or services made available in an enterprise to help with particular business and process needs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2316275">LOB</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321739">লাইন-অফ-বিজনেস</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39878_2316275_2321740"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Of, pertaining to, or characteristic of apps or services made available in an enterprise to help with particular business and process needs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2316275">LOB</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321740">LOB</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39880_2320100_2325413"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app for PC and Surface Hub that helps you connect a phone or PC to the Surface Hub display, or to another PC. On Surface Hub, it also allows you to switch between devices that are connected to the Surface Hub.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2320100">Connect</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2325413">সংযোগ করা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39881_2320112_2325416"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mode in which the UI on the screen slides downward so that the user can reach items that normally would be near the top of the screen with one hand.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2320112">one-handed use</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2325416">এক হাতে- করা ব্যবহার</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39882_2320437_2321742"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app for purchasing cellular data that is packaged with cellular enabled Dell devices that include a Microsoft SIM card.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2320437">Dell NetReady</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321742">Dell NetReady</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39889_2321509_2325421"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection of TV shows that are in the top N% of ratings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321509">Top-rated TV shows</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2325421">সেরা-রেটপ্রাপ্ত TV শোগুলি</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39889_2321509_2332338"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection of TV shows that are in the top N% of ratings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321509">Top-rated TV shows</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2332338">শীর্ষ রেট দেওয়া টিভি শোগুলি</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39890_2321510_2325414"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection of items emphasized to the customer through placement on the site.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321510">Featured collections</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2325414">বৈশিষ্ট্যযুক্ত সংগ্রহগুলি</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39891_2321511_2325418"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To make your search results more relevant by excluding unwanted and extraneous items.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321511">refine</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2325418">পরিশোধন করুন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNo