te and reminder for the task.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331939">Smart Due Dates</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340427">স্মার্ট বকেয়া তারিখগুলো</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40123_2331939_2340514"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Wunderlist feature that allows users to enter due dates for a task as text (e.g. next Sunday), automatically recognize the date, and set a due date and reminder for the task.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331939">Smart Due Dates</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340514">স্মার্ট বকেয়া তারিখগুলি</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40124_2332081_2340419"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that gives users information regarding the safety of a message via a colored bar inserted into the message.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2332081">Safety Tips</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340419">সুরক্ষাজনিত পরামর্শসমূহ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40126_2332083_2340400"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows administrators to inform email senders that they may be about to violate one of the data loss prevention policies.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2332083">Policy Tips</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340400">নীতি বিজ্ঞপ্তিসমূহ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40161_2333639_2342449"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows you to tap a phone against another device to pay for a purchase using a credit or debit card enrolled in Microsoft Wallet as a method of payment.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2333639">tap to pay</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2342449">অর্থপ্রদানের জন্য আলতো চাপুন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40162_2333642_2340377"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A UI element that gives a user a view of the important email, as presorted by the Focused Inbox fea