cted based on downloads, usage, and revenue over a 7-day period and ranks them according to those metrics.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2358041">Most popular</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2359479">সর্বাধিক জনপ্রিয়</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40633_2358042_2358936"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The category for items that are in the top 1000 items based on sales.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2358042">Best selling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2358936">সর্বোচ্চ বিক্রি</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40633_2358042_2359478"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The category for items that are in the top 1000 items based on sales.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2358042">Best selling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2359478">সর্বোচ্চ বিক্রয়</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40652_2358625_2358944"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The view of a particular contact within the People app that shows all your past communication, upcoming meetings, status updates, and files you share with that person. ​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2358625">Timeline</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2358944">সময়রেখা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40653_2358634_2434768"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To remove a shortcut to an application or part of an application from the Start screen (the full screen view of Start) or Start menu.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2358634">unpin from Start</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2434768">স্টার্ট মেনু থেকে আনপিন করুন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40655_2361528_2471720"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The application that lets users sync files from OneDrive for Business or Microsoft SharePoint to their local computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2361528">OneDrive sync client</term><termNote type="partOfSpee