rt professional to help solve a problem with your PC by accessing and taking control of it over a remote connection.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2373342">Quick Assist</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2373794">দ্রুত সহায়তা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41921_2373342_3161319"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app included in Windows that allows a trusted friend or support professional to help solve a problem with your PC by accessing and taking control of it over a remote connection.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2373342">Quick Assist</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161319">Microsoft দ্রুত সহায়তা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41921_3160521_2373794"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app included in Windows that allows a trusted friend or support professional to help solve a problem with your PC by accessing and taking control of it over a remote connection.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3160521">Microsoft Quick Assist</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2373794">দ্রুত সহায়তা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41921_3160521_3161319"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app included in Windows that allows a trusted friend or support professional to help solve a problem with your PC by accessing and taking control of it over a remote connection.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3160521">Microsoft Quick Assist</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161319">Microsoft দ্রুত সহায়তা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41928_2374250_2376582"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The parts of a model that hang with no support, and therefore are likely to collapse during printing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374250">overhang</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2376582">আলম্বিত</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41929_2374256_2376584"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mesh printed along with a model meant to support overhangs and balance the model while it prints.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374256">raft</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2376584">ভেলা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41930_2374257_2376585"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An item that is printed with a model to support and balance a model while it prints.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374257">support</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2376585">সহায়তা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41931_2374260_2377888"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Zoom feature that allows users to create a pictorial table of contents containing a collection of their Section Zooms and that can update if the presentation is edited.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374260">Summary Zoom</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2377888">সারাংশ জুম করুন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41932_2374261_2377887"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Zoom feature that presents a preview of a slide in a presentation which auto-updates when the slide is updated and navigates users to that slide when they click on the preview</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374261">Slide Zoom</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2377887">স্লাইড জুম করুন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41933_2374264_2377886"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Zoom feature that presents a preview of a section in a presentation which auto-updates when the section’s first slide is updated, navigates users to that section when they click on the preview, and returns them back to the Summary Zoom when they are done.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374264">Section Zoom</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2377886">অধ্যায় জুম করুন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41937_2374321_2376566"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A lock screen feature for mobile devices that lets users see their clock and lock screen info at a glance after your screen has turned off.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374321">glance screen</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2376566">একনজরে স্ক্রিন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41938_2374322_2513438"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that teachers can use to provision student PCs for classroom use.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374322">Set up School PCs</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513438">স্কুলের PC-গুলো সেট আপ কর</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41938_2374322_2513453"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that teachers can use to provision student PCs for classroom use.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374322">Set up School PCs</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513453">স্কুলের PCগুলি সেট করুন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammatica