ive intelligence into applications without having direct artificial intelligence (AI) or data science skills or knowledge.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2395933">Cognitive Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2840924">জ্ঞান সম্বন্ধীয় পরিষেবা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42338_2898059_2840924"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The family of cloud-base services with REST APIs, and client library SDKs available to help developers build cognitive intelligence into applications without having direct artificial intelligence (AI) or data science skills or knowledge.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2898059">Azure Cognitive Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2840924">জ্ঞান সম্বন্ধীয় পরিষেবা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42351_2396187_2397175"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows Hello feature gives business customers the fastest and most secure way to sign-in to Windows devices, apps and services. It uses your face, fingerprint or companion device to recognize you instantly, no password needed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2396187">Windows Hello for Business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2397175">ব্যবসার জন্য Windows Hello</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42352_2396192_2397163"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The gaming category where you can get clothing, weapons, tools or other useful items you can add to your game avatar.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2396192">Avatar items</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2397163">অবতার আইটেমগুলি</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42352_2396192_2397165"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The gaming category where you can get clothing, weapons, tools or other useful items you can add to your game avatar.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2396192">Avatar items</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2397165">অবতার আইটেম</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42353_2396193_2397167"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The game category with games that allow you to use your phone to interact with Xbox. You can browse and type on Xbox live using your phone instead of the controller.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2396193">Companion</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2397167">কম্প্যানিয়ন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42353_2396193_2397174"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The game category with games that allow you to use your phone to interact with Xbox. You can browse and type on Xbox live using your phone instead of the controller.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2396193">Companion</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2397174">ক্যম্পনিয়ন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42354_2396194_2898433"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app category that offers utility apps which allow you to change settings and test network connections.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2396194">Tools</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></nti