n enterprise administrator. Everything not on that list is considered untrusted.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2721513">Application Guard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2723448">Application Guard</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43468_2721513_3086082"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that helps to isolate enterprise-defined untrusted sites based on a list of trusted web sites, cloud resources and internal networks defined by an enterprise administrator. Everything not on that list is considered untrusted.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2721513">Application Guard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3086082">Microsoft Defender অ্যাপ্লিকেশন গার্ড</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43468_2795831_2723437"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that helps to isolate enterprise-defined untrusted sites based on a list of trusted web sites, cloud resources and internal networks defined by an enterprise administrator. Everything not on that list is considered untrusted.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2795831">Microsoft Defender Application Guard</term><termNote type="partOf