ttons in dialog boxes, choosing menu items, and selecting ranges of cells in spreadsheets or groups of words in a document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="93293">pointing device</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="471817">নির্দেশক ডিভাইস</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44800_2520756_2522300"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An open file format created as a simple way to import and export geometry from different 3D applications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2520756">OBJ</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2522300">OBJ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44803_2521100_2673893"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The framework that consists of a web part and a page that provides full support for client-side SharePoint development, easy integration with SharePoint data, and support for open source tooling so that developers can use their preferred tools and technologies.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2521100">SharePoint Framework</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2673893">SPFx</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44803_2673786_2673893"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The framework that consists of a web part and a page that provides full support for client-side SharePoint development, easy integration with SharePoint data, and support for open source tooling so that developers can use their preferred tools and technologies.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2673786">SPFx</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2673893">SPFx</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44804_2521102_2523047"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collection of benefits provided to developers for creating software on a particular platform after they register for membership, and which may include access to software and information not available to people who have not registered.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2521102">developer program</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2523047">বিকাশকারী প্রোগ্রাম</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44805_2521104_2523056"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The developer program for Microsoft Office that provides members access to trainings and office hours with Microsoft engineers, plus chances to win tickets to events.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2521104">Microsoft Office Developer Program</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2523056">Microsoft Office বিকাশকারী প্রোগ্রাম</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44809_2521577_2523933"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Excel add-in that finds functions needed to transform and format data when the user gives it examples of the desired output.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2521577">Transform Data by Example</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2523933">Transform Data by Example</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4481_1133582_1996504"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows feature that allows users to connect remotely to a computer and access programs, files, and network resources as though they were sitting at the computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1133582">RD</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1996504">রিমোট ডেস্কটপ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4481_543804_1996504"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows feature that allows users to connect remotely to a computer and access programs, files, and network resources as though they were sitting at the computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="543804">Remote Desktop</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1996504">রিমোট ডেস্কটপ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44810_2521581_2525197"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A membership where admittance is based on rules, making it easy for administrators to manage large groups.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2521581">dynamic membership</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2525197">ডায়নামিক সদস্যতা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44810_2521581_2526025"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A membership where admittance is based on rules, making it easy for administrators to manage large groups.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2521581">dynamic membership</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2526025">ডায়নামিক সদস্যতা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44811_2521582_2525196"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group where membership is maintained by a set of rules created by an administrator.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2521582">dynamic group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2525196">ডায়নামিক গোষ্ঠী</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44811_2521582_2526023"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group where membership is maintained by a set of rules created by an administrator.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2521582">dynamic group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="25260