omatically without ringing anyone, only by displaying a notification, through which the rest of users of the group can join the call.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2652448">Go Live</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2652906">গো লাইভ-এ কল করুন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47077_2652497_2653369"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A string that is displayed when a cell that requires validation is selected and that gives instructions to the people using the spreadsheet on valid input.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2652497">input message</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2653369">ইনপুট বার্তা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47078_2652498_2653371"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A software system that determines the likelihood of incoming emails being a phishing attempt due to analysis of previous emailing history.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2652498">mailbox intelligence</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2653371">মেলবক্স বুদ্ধিমত্তা