ar</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2740944">Microsoft ক্লাউড চুক্তি</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48463_2737540_2821843"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Attack activity involving establishing communications to report status, relay reconnaissance results, receive additional commands, or transmit stolen data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2737540">command-and-control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2821843">C&amp;C</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48463_2737540_2821845"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Attack activity involving establishing communications to report status, relay reconnaissance results, receive additional commands, or transmit stolen data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2737540">command-and-control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2821845">C2</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48463_2819508_2821843"><langSet xm