ent from being saved until they are reconciled.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2753781">page conflict</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2755411">পৃষ্ঠা দ্বন্দ্ব</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48679_2753782_2755273"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A total amount of time spent at work emailing, in meetings, and on chats or calls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2753782">collaboration time</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2755273">সহযোগিতার সময়</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48682_2753813_2755283"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A number that identifies a row in an Excel sheet in order, starting at 1.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2753813">row index</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2755283">সারি সূচী</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet>