e offer for Microsoft 365 that includes Skype for Business integrations with telephone system, Office 365 Advanced Threat Protection, Customer Lockbox,Power BI Pro, as well as both the Microsoft Office desktop apps and the online versions. It includes all the features of ProPlus and Office 365 E1 plus security and compliance tools, such as legal hold, data loss prevention, and more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2815538">Office 365 E3</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2815836">Office 365 E3</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49756_2815539_2815857"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The offer for Microsoft 365 that includes Skype for Business integrations with telephone system, Office 365 Advanced Threat Protection, Customer Lockbox,Power BI Pro, as well as both the Microsoft Office desktop apps and the online versions. It includes all the features of Office 365 E3 plus advanced security, analytics, and voice capabilities.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2815539">Office 365 E5</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2815857">Office 365 E5</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49764_2815600_2816043"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descrip