e="definition">In Microsoft 365 scores, a recommendation based on data from your organization, which, if completed, results directly or indirectly in points earned to improve your score. This can be a direct action like changing a setting, or an indirect action like providing training to users that encourages them to use a feature more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819449">recommendation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2821851">উন্নয়ন কার্য</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49868_2819449_2821862"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Microsoft 365 scores, a recommendation based on data from your organization, which, if completed, results directly or indirectly in points earned to improve your score. This can be a direct action like changing a setting, or an indirect action like providing training to users that encourages them to use a feature more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819449">recommendation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2821862">সুপারিশ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49869_2819450_2821836"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Status of a Microsoft Managed Desktop device if it meets all of these criteria: synced with Intune in the last 5 days AND at least 6 hours powered on and connected to Internet AND at least 2 hours continuously powered on and connected to Internet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819450">active</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2821836">সক্রিয়</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49870_2819451_2821839"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A minimum or starting point used for comparisons.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819451">baseline</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2821839">বেসলাইন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49871_2819453_2821867"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A summary page in Microsoft 365 admin center showing all scores for your organization side by side.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819453">score overview</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2821867">স্কোরের উপরিবীক্ষণ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><te