ience Pack</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929161">Windows ওয়েব অভিজ্ঞতা প্যাক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52005_2929086_2929458"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft Bookings user with an admin role.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929086">Bookings admin</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929458">Bookings অ্যাডমিন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52006_2929515_2929671"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows Server file sharing feature that allows users to set caps on the portion of network capacity taken up by traffic using the SMB protocol.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929515">SMB bandwidth limit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929671">SMB ব্যান্ডউইথ সীমা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52008_2929517_2929672"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows feature that uses hardware virtualization to create and isolate a secure region of memory from the normal operating system which can be used to host security solutions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929517">virtualization-based security</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929672">VBS</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52008_2929517_2929674"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows feature that uses hardware virtualization to create and isolate a secure region of memory from the normal operating system which can be used to host security solutions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929517">virtualization-based security</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929674">ভার্চুয়ালাইজেশন ভিত্তিক নিরাপত্তা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52008_2929518_2929672"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows feature that uses hardware virtualization to create and isolate a secure region of memory from the normal operating system which can be used to host security solutions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929518">VBS</term><termNote type=