 support, and personalized advice from small business specialists.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2930013">Business Assist for Microsoft 365</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2931165">Microsoft 365-এর জন্য ব্যবসায়ে সহায়তা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52046_2930015_2931246"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The category name for a group of features that enable collaboration with external users in Microsoft Teams.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2930015">Microsoft Teams Connect</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2931246">Microsoft Teams-এ সংযোগ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52046_2930015_3060597"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The category name for a group of features that enable collaboration with external users in Microsoft Teams.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2930015">Microsoft Teams Connect</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3060597">Teams-এ সংযোগ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="pa