"partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53216_3031669_3032099"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A search ad that allows you to set multiple ad headlines and ad descriptions within a single ad.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031669">responsive search ad</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3032099">প্রতিক্রিয়ামূলক সার্চের বিজ্ঞাপন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53217_3031670_3032105"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A search ad that contains images and videos.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031670">rich search ad</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3032105">সমৃদ্ধ সার্চের বিজ্ঞাপন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53219_3031672_3032054"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The combined search and audience advertising marketplace made up of Bing, MSN, Outlook, Edge, and partner sites.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031672">Microsoft Search Network</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3032054">Microsoft সার্চ নেটওয়ার্ক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53220_3031831_3032684"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A policy template that helps detect cross-country or cross-region data transfers, identify the amount and types of personal data being transferred, and take actions to remediate risks, such as applying additional encryption or restricting access for the data being transferred.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031831">cross-border transfers</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3032684">অন্য দেশে স্থানান্তরগুলি</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53221_3031832_3032681"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A transfer of personal data across a geographic border (such as country or regional borders).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031832">cross-border transfer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3032681">অন্য দেশে স্থানান্তর</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53222_3031833_3032699"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A policy template that helps detect personal data with external, excessive, and idle access and trigger remediation actions including sending notifications to the data or site owners to remove unnecessary accesses.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031833">data overexposure</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3032699">ডেটার সাথে অতিরিক্তভাবে সম্মুখীন হওয়া</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53223_3031834_3032690"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A policy template that helps detect personal data that has not been used for more than 90 days and trigger remediation actions, including sending notifications to data owners to apply retention labels or disposing of the information immediately.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031834">data minimization</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3032690">ডেটা হ্রাস</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53224_3031835_3032661"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The metered service that enables licensed M365 commercial, consumer, and education users to use Office Online to view, edit, and coauthor documents stored on cloud storage providers other than SharePoint or OneDrive.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031835">Coauthoring</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3032661">সহঅনুমোদন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53225_3053615_3053843"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The cross-industry experience app in Microsoft Teams that provides seamless scheduling, analytics, and premium experiences for business-to-customer meetings, bringing together current virtual appointment experiences into one single entry point.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3053615">Virtual Appointments</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3053843">ভার্চুয়াল অ্যাপয়েন্টমেন্টগুলি</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53225_3153774_3053843"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The cross-industry experience app in Microsoft Teams that provides seamless scheduling, analytics, and premium experiences for business-to-customer meetings, bringing together current virtual appointment experiences into one single entry point.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3153774">Virtual Appts</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3053843">ভার্চুয়াল অ্যাপয়েন্টমেন্টগুলি</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53226_3031837_3032709"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The legacy version of School Data Sync.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031837">School Data Sync (classic)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3032709">স্কুল ডেটা সিঙ্ক (ক্লাসিক)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53227_3031838_3032706"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The device marketplace in the Microsoft Teams Admin Center that drives discovery and adoption of Teams devices from Teams Admin Center marketplace.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031838">Microsoft Teams device store</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3032706">Microsoft Teams ডিভাইসের স্টোর</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53235_3033414_3034864"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The simulator for ARDK head-mounted displays that runs on Windows PCs and requires a physical + connected Samsung phone.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3033414">ARDK Simulator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3034864">ARDK সিমুলেটর</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53236_3033415_3034863"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The application for ARDK users that provides the software platform for ARDK features like hand tracking and eye tracking.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3033415">ARDK Platform</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3034863">ARDK প্ল্যাটফর্ম</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53237_3033416_3034862"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The application for ARDK users that hosts the system UI, including the application launcher, dock, and task bar.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3033416">ARDK Home</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3034862">ARDK হোম</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53238_3033417_3034860"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The application for ARDK users to calibrate their eyes for the eye tracker.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3033417">ARDK Eye Calibration</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3034860">ARDK চোখ ক্যালিব্রেশন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53246_3033423_3034861"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The phone application that allows users to submit feedback from their Samsung phone about a problem with their ARDK head-mounted display.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3033423">ARDK Feedback</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3034861">ARDK মতামত</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53247_3033521_3034573"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The UK bank holiday celebrated on June 3, 2022 to commemorate the 70th anniversary of Queen Elizabeth II's accession to the throne.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3033521">Platinum Jubilee Bank Holiday</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3034573">প্ল্যাটিনাম জুবিলি ব্যাঙ্ক হলিডে</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5325_145206_1413443"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To minimize the duplication of information in a relational database through effective table design.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="145206">normalize</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1413443">স্বাভাবিক করা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5325_145206_1467506"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To minimize the duplication of information in a relational database through effective table design.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="145206">normalize</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1467506">সাধারণকরণ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5325_145206_472124"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To minimize the duplication of information in a relational database through effective table design.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="145206">normalize</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="472124">স্বাভাবিক করুন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53251_3033532_3034568"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Canadian holiday (colloquially known as Orange Shirt Day) celebrated on September 30 to recognize the legacy of the Canadian Indian residential school system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3033532">National Day for Truth and Reconciliation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3034568">জাতীয় সত্য ও পুনর্মিলন দিবস</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53252_3033536_3034563"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The US federal holiday celebrated on June 19 to commemorate the emancipation of African-American slaves, celebrated on the anniversary of June 19, 1865, the date of the announcement of General Order No. 3 by Union Army general Gordon Granger proclaiming freedom for slaves 