licies to Microsoft’s DLP solution.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3048648">Migration Assistant for Microsoft Purview Data Loss Prevention</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3048832">Microsoft Purview ডেটা হারানো প্রতিরোধের জন্য মাইগ্রেশন অ্যাসিস্ট্যান্ট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53584_3049466_3051906"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The support plan designed to match the needs of an organization by providing comprehensive support coverage for their entire Microsoft portfolio through a mix of reactive, proactive, and in-depth support solutions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3049466">Microsoft Unified Enterprise Support</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3051906">Microsoft একীকৃত এন্টারপ্রাইজ সহায়তা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53584_3049466_3051909"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The support plan designed to match the needs of an organization by providing comprehensive support coverage for their entire Microsoft portfolio through a mix of reactive, proactive, and in-depth support solutions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3049466">Microsoft Unified Enterprise Support</ter