er">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3121786">ISV সফল</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53715_3057909_3058857"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Philanthropies program that provides technology grants and discounts to nonprofit organizations all over the world.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3057909">Tech for Social Impact</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3058857">সামাজিক প্রভাবের জন্য প্রযুক্তি</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53716_3057910_3058861"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A series of games or contests in Microsoft Teams that make up a single unit of competition to promote new learnings and healthy usage of tools and scenarios across the organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3057910">tournament</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3058861">টুর্নামেন্ট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53717_3057911_3058832"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Teams feature that intelligently arranges meeting elements for optimal viewing by automatically adjusting the layout when people join, turn on the video, or present.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3057911">Dynamic view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3058832">ডায়নামিক ভিউ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53718_3057912_3058845"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Microsoft Teams, a one-touch experience for joining third-party online meetings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3057912">one-touch join</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3058845">একবার স্পর্শ করে যোগ দেওয়া</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53719_3057913_3058829"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in the Microsoft Teams calls app that allows users to combine calls together.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3057913">call merge</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3058829">কল মার্জ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53720_3057914_3058834"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Teams feature that allows users to seamlessly move their calls between different devices, such as from the laptop to a mobile phone and vice-versa, without any interruption in call service or quality.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3057914">endpoint transfer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3058834">এন্ডপয়েন্ট স্থানান্তর</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53721_3057915_3058848"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A conversation method that uses a button to switch a device from the voice transmission mode to the voice reception mode.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3057915">push-to-talk</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3058848">কথা বলতে পুশ করুন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53721_3057915_3058850"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="de