Note type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53722_3059076_3060002"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that provides a direct path to Windows 365 from the Task Bar or Start menu, with a personal, customized experience that can be tailored to each individual.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3059076">Windows 365 app</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3060002">Windows 365 অ্যাপ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53723_3059078_3060005"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection of AI-powered audiovisual effects available on Windows.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3059078">Windows Studio effects</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3060005">Windows স্টুডিওর প্রভাব</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53725_3059304_3060571"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows the user to share different types of content with others in an online meeting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3059304">content sharing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3060571">কন্টেন্ট শেয়ারিং</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53727_3059305_3060570"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in Microsoft Teams that enables users to join a meeting from a conference room with their own personal device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3059305">companion device</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3060570">সহযোগী ডিভাইস</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53728_3059306_3060593"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A technology that allows you to share content from physical whiteboards and documents in a high-quality way during meetings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3059306">intelligent content capture</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3060593">ইন্টেলিজেন্ট কন্টেন্ট ক্যাপচার</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53729_3059307_3060572"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that enables Microsoft 365 Enterprise users to streamline communication, collaboration, and meeting-related tasks using spoken natural language.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3059307">Cortana voice assistance</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3060572">Cortana ভয়েস সহায়তা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53730_3059308_3060581"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows users to join a third-party online meeting from their Teams Rooms just as easily as they can join meetings hosted in Teams.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3059308">Direct Guest Join</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3060581">অতিথির সরাসরি যোগদান</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53731_3059309_3060588"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A camera that supports AI-powered active speaker tracking, multiple video streams, and people recognition.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3059309">intelligent camera</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3060588">ইন্টেলিজেন্ট ক্যামেরা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53732_3187998_3065062"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Clipchamp, the paid plan that offers access to premium features for everyday editors.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3187998">Premium</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3065062">এসেনশিয়ালস</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53733_3060419_3072763"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An area in Clipchamp's video editor where all components are assembled and arranged on tracks.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3060419">timeline</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3072763">টাইমলাইন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53734_3060420_3072766"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A component of the timeline where editing elements such as videos, images, audio, stickers, text blocks, etc. are placed and arranged to create a video.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3060420">track</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3072766">ট্র্যাক</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53735_3060421_3065025"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collection of branded assets such as logos, fonts, colors and images that are uploaded to be used in graphic designing or video editing projects.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3060421">brand kit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3065025">ব্র্যান্ড কিট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53736_3060422_3072750"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A video clip from a library of professional stock assets that is integrated in the Clipchamp video editor for use in editing projects.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3060422">stock video</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3072750">স্টক ভিডিও</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfS