OfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3096709">নিরাপত্তা সম্পর্কিত ঘটনা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54303_3096555_3096705"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The mitigation of violations of security policies and recommended practices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3096555">incident handling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3096705">ঘটনা পরিচালনা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54304_3096556_3096707"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A security incident that involves the accidental or unauthorized exposure or alteration of customer content and end-user identifiable information (EUII) in Microsoft 365 services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3096556">privacy issue</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3096707">গোপনীয়তা সম্পর্কিত সমস্যা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54312_3097234_3098572"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An observable change to the normal behavior of a system, environment, process, workflow or person; any observable occurrence in a system or network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3097234">security event</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3098572">নিরাপত্তা সম্পর্কিত ইভেন্ট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54313_3097235_3098570"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An automated notification resulting from a detection.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3097235">security alert</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3098570">নিরাপত্তা সম্পর্কিত সতর্কীকরণ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54314_3097236_3098571"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Engagement of the Microsoft incident response team via formal engagement procedures indicating a potential security issue that requires investigation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3097236">security escalation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><t