Selected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54567_3100236_3100618"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows IT admins to create policies for specific priority users (C-Suite) that filter out unwanted communication.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100236">priority account chat control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100618">অগ্রাধিকারযুক্ত অ্যাকাউন্টের চ্যাট নিয়ন্ত্রণ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54568_3100237_3100616"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows IT admins to customize backgrounds for licensed users in an organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100237">organization meeting background</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100616">সংগঠনের ব্যবহারকারীদের জন্য মিটিংয়ের ব্যাকগ্রাউন্ড</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54569_3100238_3100617"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows IT admins to customize Together Mode scenes for licensed users in an organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100238">organization together mode scene</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</te