d</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119918">ইকো-স্ট্যান্ডার্ড</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55023_3118515_3123088"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Microsoft Teams, a meeting view that users can switch into in order to use a Mesh space for the meeting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3118515">immersive space</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3123088">ইমারসিভ স্পেস</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55026_3118923_3118932"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The different services and products that are accessible to users within Microsoft Fabric.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3118923">analytics artifacts</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3118932">অ্যানালিটিক্স নিদর্শন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55027_3119009_3119018"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of comprehensive systems, too