lected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55095_3123667_3123911"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Bing Maps feature that shows a real-time video in 3D of a low flight by a plane over a specific location.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3123667">3D Flyover</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3123911">3D Flyover</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55098_3123959_3124731"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A two-dimensional data structure for storing and manipulating data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3123959">DataFrame</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3124731">DataFrame</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55099_3123960_3124153"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The error in Excel that is shown when a formula is waiting for a required resource that’s taking a long time to access.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3123960">#BUSY</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3124153">#ব্যস্ত</te