 that streamlines the process of managing first-party and third-party apps from end-to-end by providing access to a secure, prepackaged catalog.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3129694">Microsoft Intune Enterprise Application Management</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3130986">Microsoft Intune Enterprise Application Management</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55253_3129695_3130983"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The add-in that streamlines the process of managing first-party and third-party apps from end-to-end by providing access to a secure, prepackaged catalog.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3129695">Enterprise Application Management</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3130983">Enterprise Application Management</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55253_3129695_3130986"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The add-in that streamlines the process of managing first-party and third-party apps from end-to-end by providing access to a secure, prepackaged catalog.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3129695">Enterprise Application Management</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperN