ter their requests for Copilot in natural language. It is the user’s interaction point with the system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3153897">prompt bar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3154117">প্রম্পট বার</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56092_3153898_3156013"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that provides real-time exploration of a machine's operational information, spanning from hardware specifications, such as memory usage, to software configuration, including installed applications, registry keys, and networking settings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3153898">device query</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3156013">ডিভাইস কোয়্যারী</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56093_3153899_3156012"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows organizations to selectively scan and protect historical older data using the latest enhanced advanced classifiers, to comprehensively identify and protect their sensitive corporate intellectual property and PII.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3153899">data scan</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammatica