aticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="573_231958_472373"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of coordinates that a cell occupies on a worksheet. For example, the reference of the cell that appears at the intersection of column B and row 3 is B3.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="231958">cell reference</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="472373">কক্ষ উল্লেখ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5731_155920_1854412"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A method of preventing a denial of service attack by limiting the number of requests that can be made to a system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="155920">throttling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1854412">অনুরোধ হ্রাস</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5731_1645777_1854412"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A method of preventing a denial of service attack by limiting the number of requests that can be made to a system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1645777">request throttling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig