l, upward-pointing symbol (^) typically found over the 6 key on the top row of a microcomputer keyboard.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="49737">caret</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1255877">ক্যারেট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6146_142043_472106"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A technique for filtering data that uses a version of the current form or datasheet with empty fields in which you can type the values you want the filtered records to contain.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="142043">Filter By Form</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="472106">রূপ অনুযায়ী ফিল্টার করা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6146_142043_614034"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A technique for filtering data that uses a version of the current form or datasheet with empty fields in which you can type the values you want the filtered records to contain.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="142043">Filter By Form</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="614034">ফর্ম অনুযায়ী ছাঁকুন</term