on's status, activity, location, willingness to communicate, and contact information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1354392">presence information</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2297252">উপস্থিতি</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6987_230790_1959700"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collection of attributes that provides an indication of a person's status, activity, location, willingness to communicate, and contact information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="230790">presence</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1959700">উপস্থিতি</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6987_230790_2297252"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collection of attributes that provides an indication of a person's status, activity, location, willingness to communicate, and contact information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="230790">presence</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2297252">উপস্থিতি</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type