used in a trusted domain.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="253747">local account</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2708890">লোকাল অ্যাকাউন্ট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9534_258951_1258060"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The degree of precision and exactness with which one entity represents another.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="258951">fidelity</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1258060">বিশ্বস্ততা</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9536_61276_1772467"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">For a computer system, to be in an inactive state, but not shut off. When the computer is switched back on, the desktop is restored exactly as it was.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="61276">hibernate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1772467">সুপ্ত করুন</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9536_61276_471582"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">For a computer system, to be in an inactive state, but not shut off. When the computer is switched back on, the desktop is restored exactly as it was.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="61276">hibernate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="471582">হাইবারনেট</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9543_415057_1853941"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A member of a dimension whose value is calculated at run time by using an expression. Calculated member values can be derived from the values of other members.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="415057">calculated member</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="bn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1853941">গণনাকৃত সদস্য</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND, BGD</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9547_177819_472245"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A document that contains general release information and late changes. It is one of the deliverables leading to the release readiness approved milestone.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="177819">release notes</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNu